are referred to licensed insurance advisers and brokers who are regulated under New Zealand law. Personal protection information links directly to providers and official resources."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The information on this website is general in nature and does not constitute financial advice. Always seek professional advice before purchasing insurance products."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"© 2026 FraudProtection.co.nz"}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/privacy","className":"hover:text-slate-300","children":"Privacy Policy"}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/terms","className":"hover:text-slate-300","children":"Terms of Use"}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/sitemap.xml","className":"hover:text-slate-300","children":"Sitemap"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]],null],null],["$L8",null]]]]
